    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -570,
        "y": 70
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "PPO is one network with two heads: an actor that gives a probability for each action, and a critic that scores the state. They share a trunk, so the value estimate and the policy learn from the same features. What makes it PPO is the clipped objective in the update - a step that moves the policy too far gets cut back - and that update is not in this graph.\n\nThe observation is a random tensor standing in for a Humanoid-style state of 376 joint angles, velocities and contacts, so no gym or mujoco install is needed; swap in EnvWrapper for a live environment. Nothing here is trained.\n\nPPO 是一個網路、兩個頭：actor 給出每個動作的機率，critic 給這個狀態打分。兩者共用一段軀幹，所以價值估計和策略是從同一批特徵學的。真正讓它叫 PPO 的是更新時那個截斷目標 — 策略一步走太遠就會被砍回來 — 而那段更新不在這張圖裡。\n\n觀測是隨機張量，代替 Humanoid 那種 376 維的狀態（關節角度、速度、接觸），所以不必安裝 gym 或 mujoco；要接真環境就換成 EnvWrapper。這裡不訓練任何東西。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start-1",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -420,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 360
      }
    },

    {
      "id": "note-ppo-1",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -290,
        "y": 700
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "The node builds a 376-256-256 trunk with Tanh, then splits: the actor gives 17 action probabilities through a softmax, the critic one value. Only the probabilities leave the node - the value is computed inside forward and has no port.\n\n這個節點先搭出 376-256-256 的軀幹（用 Tanh），再分岔：actor 經 softmax 給 17 個動作機率，critic 給一個價值。只有機率會離開這個節點 — 價值是在 forward 裡算出來的，沒有對應的埠。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "ppo-1",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -340,
          "y": 300
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    },

    {
      "id": "note-seq-model",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 400,
        "y": 20
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Off the data path: only the trigger edge reaches it. It writes the actor's side - 376-256-256-17 with ReLU - as one layer stack you can open in the layer editor. The PPO node's own trunk uses Tanh and adds the critic head, which a single stack cannot show.\n\n它不在資料路徑上，只有 trigger 那條邊會走到它。它把 actor 那一側寫成一份層堆疊 376-256-256-17（用 ReLU），可以在層編輯器裡打開。PPO 節點自己的軀幹用的是 Tanh，還多一個 critic 頭，那是單一堆疊畫不出來的。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "seq-model",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -380
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    },

    {
      "id": "note-optimizer-1",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 400,
        "y": 1240
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Built over ppo-1's parameters and never stepped: there is no rollout, no advantage and no clipped loss in this graph. It shows where the optimizer attaches - to the agent's network, not to seq-model.\n\n它建在 ppo-1 的參數上，但從來沒被 step 過：這張圖沒有 rollout、沒有優勢值，也沒有截斷損失。它只是標出優化器接的位置 — 接的是代理人的網路，不是 seq-model。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "optimizer-1",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 240
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    }
  ],
